description: Go test conventions for this repo (fixtures, comments)
globs: "**/*_test.go"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Go tests

- Prefer **checked-in fixtures** under `<package>/testdata/` instead of `t.TempDir()` for inputs, unless the test specifically needs a writable target (e.g. copy-into-temp integration tests).
- Add a **short comment** on each test function (and on table-driven case rows when intent is not obvious) explaining what scenario is exercised.
- Mirror fixture directory names with subtest names when using table-driven tests.
